abilities.effect:
When looking into flames you can get vague flickers of the future. The clarity is affected by how far you attempt to look as well as the size of the flame. While nothing you see is ever certain, you are adept enough to gain faint glimmers of the future.
&nbsp;
When using this aspect of your craft, gain +1 die on Skill Challenges .

You can control flames within a short radius. You may effortlessly quash anything smaller than a bonfire, and can instantly create a campfire-sized flames. With focus you can move flames or cause them to grow in size, and you can sustain a torch-sized flame without fuel and with with minimal effort.
&nbsp;
When using this aspect of your craft, gain +1 die on Skill Challenges .

You may move and control a single nearby earthen object that you could physically lift with good precision. You have finer control and greater range when manipulating lighter objects. Additionally, you can easily chill or freeze a small amount of water.
&nbsp;
When using this aspect of your craft, gain +1 die on _Skill Challenges_.

You can control water. You may control nearby water, and can easily form it into different shapes. You may control approximately a tub's worth of water at a time, although it does not need to all be a single mass.
&nbsp;
When using this aspect of your craft, gain +1 die on Skill Challenges .

You can draw upon the earth and use it to enhance your physical strength and vitality, giving you a greater edge in tests of strength and resilience. Given time and sufficient footing you can draw even greater strength, allowing you to temporarily reach the pinnacle of human strength.
&nbsp;
When using this aspect of your craft, gain +1 die on Skill Challenges .

You can effectively 'feel' things through the air around you, granting you enhanced senses and the ability to detect changes around your near-instantly. Additionally, with focus, you can enhance your ability to sense things that might be carried by the wind, such as sight and smells, which may grant additional insights. This can allow you to hear and smell at much greater distances, as well as giving you a general sense of activity at nearby locations, even if you cannot see them.
&nbsp;
When using this aspect of your craft, gain +1 die on Skill Challenges .

You may move and control a single nearby earthen object that you could physically lift with good precision. You have finer control and greater range when manipulating lighter objects.
&nbsp;
When using this aspect of your craft, gain +1 die on Skill Challenges .

You can manipulate nearby earth and soil easily, and can simultaneously move a wheelbarrow's worth of earth. You can shape this earth readily and, while you maintain your focus, you can keep it any shape.
&nbsp;
When using this aspect of your craft, gain +1 die on Skill Challenges .

You can control lighting and, while your control is not absolute, you can readily bend it away from others.
&nbsp;
When using this aspect of your craft, gain +1 die on _Skill Challenges_.

You may move and control a single nearby wooden object that you could physically lift with good precision. You have finer control and greater range when manipulating lighter objects.
&nbsp;
When using this aspect of your craft, gain +1 die on Skill Challenges .

You may move and control a single nearby metallic object that you could physically lift with good precision. You have finer control and greater range when manipulating lighter objects.
&nbsp;
When using this aspect of your craft, gain +1 die on Skill Challenges .

You can modify the physical properties of metal to a moderate degree, allowing you to make iron as hard as steel or the reverse. For maximum effect you must be touching the metal. The effect persists for a short time after you stop touching it. You may affect more mild change from a short distance. Finally, you can work metal with your touch with the same precision and speed as if you had metalworking tools (but not a forge) and you do not need _Smith's Tools_ to repair metal equipment.
&nbsp;
When using this aspect of your craft, gain +1 die on Skill Challenges .

You can effortlessly create powerful bursts of wind, capable of pushing people back and launching objects. In addition, you can control and manipulate the wind to create specific drafts and speed of the air, allowing you to clumsily manipulate small objects from a distance or precisely manipulating powdery substances and the like.
&nbsp;
When using this aspect of your craft, gain +1 die on Skill Challenges .

You can enhance the sense of joy in others nearby, putting them at ease and lifting their spirits a great amount.
&nbsp;
When using this aspect of your craft, gain +1 die on Skill Challenges .

You can manipulate living plant matter, encouraging growth and changing its shape. If you do this over an extended period these changes are permanent, and can result in otherwise impossible growth. Rapid forced growth and manipulation tends to stress the plants, and the spirits in the plant will force it to return to its original state after a short time. In general, you can quickly form vine-like structures from grass and other small plant life and given time can form more intricate and complex flora. You can accomplish this at a short distance, but the effect is enhanced if you are touching the plant.
&nbsp;
When using this aspect of your craft, gain +1 die on Skill Challenges .

You are a skilled artist and, regardless of your specialty, are skilled at drawing and sketching. Given appropriate tools you can faithfully reproduce images of things seen on your adventures, and excel at understanding complex imagery and how a piece of art was made, which could grant additional insight. Additionally, choose a specialty for your art such as painting or sculpture. When working on or analyzing anything that matches your specialty all of these effects are heightened. Finally, you always understand the meaning an artist was attempting to represent when seeing their art, even if that is not how you feel about it.
&nbsp;
When your background and skills as an artist would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You are a skilled merchant, and are unrivaled when it comes to appraising items, haggling, and bartering. Deals tend to always end up in your favor, and you excel at figuring out what others want.
&nbsp;
When your background and skills as a merchant would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You are a skilled delver, able to read and understand the dangerous Underworld. The labyrinthine tunnels, secret doors, and deadly traps are all routine for you, and you're able to navigate them better than almost anyone.
&nbsp;
When your background and skills as a delver would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You have studied herbs, and can identify most herbs at a glance. For those that you cannot, you at least have a general sense of their properties, and can always tell if an herb would be toxic. In addition to being able to identify herbs, you are well-versed on their properties, where they grow, and other useful details.
&nbsp;
When your background and skills as an herbalist would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You've worked on a farm, granting you a strong back and endurance. Additionally, you have a broad knowledge of plants, common livestock, what to expect with the seasons, and various other tidbits of knowledge that aid in farming. Other farmers warm to you quickly, and if you speak to them about farming for a short time they'll tend to become friendly.
&nbsp;
When your background and skills as a farmer would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You are schooled in medicine, and can determine the best of course of action for most injuries, illnesses, and other maladies. You have specific knowledge about medicines, wounds, disease, and other common medical topics.
&nbsp;
When your background and skills as a physician would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You are a skilled hunter, and have a deep knowledge of different animals, where they might live, and the best way to hunt them down. You know how to best prepare most animals found in the wild, can field dress game, and have a deep knowledge of the best ways to track various creatures.
&nbsp;
When your background and skills as a hunter would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You are well read and have absorbed a large amount of knowledge. You understand where best to find most academic knowledge within the Shattered World and (given time) can find most information.
&nbsp;
When your background as a scholar would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You are an expert on the history and significant figures, with an emphasis on your own town. Additionally, you are a skilled orator, and have dozens of engrossing tales you can tell at a moment's notice.
&nbsp;
When your background and skills as a keeper would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You are constantly wandering, and have a good sense of the rules of engagement on the road and a broad knowledge of the wider world. You can confidently size up other travelers and get a sense of how far they've gone.
&nbsp;
When your background and skills as a wanderer would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You have an innate sense of the outdoors and, while you lack the specific knowledge that a specialist might, you can identify dangers at a glance, and have  a general knowledge of the outdoors. You have broad knowledge of plants and animals, as well as common spirit dangers of the wilds.
&nbsp;
When your background and skills as a ranger would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You are used to long hours working in the forge, which has given you a strong back, endurance, and the ability to use a wide variety of heavy tools. Additionally, when seeing another smith's hands, tools, or forge you can get a sense of their skill level and personality. This ability works to a lesser extent when you see a piece of their handiwork.
&nbsp;
When your background and skills as a blacksmith would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You are well-versed in different types of metal, and can easily identify most metals and their properties at a glance. For those that you cannot, you at least have a general sense of their properties. Additionally, you have a deep understanding of metal craftsmanship, and can easily identify the strongest and weakest point on something made of metal.
&nbsp;
When your knowledge of metal would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You are well-versed in different types of weapons, as well as how they are made. You intuitively understand the function, craftsmanship, and cultural significance of weapons, and can accurately assess the condition of a weapon at a glance. Additionally, from a weapon, you can gain insight into its maker and skill level of the wielder.
&nbsp;
When your background and skills as a weaponsmith would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You are resilient against punishment and can push through effects that would stop lesser creatures in their tracks. You are resistant to pain, toxins, and other afflictions to a frightening degree and seem to have a never-ending pool of stamina.
&nbsp;
When your exceptional toughness would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You have a keen mind, and are able to think your way out of many problems. You excel at spotting patterns, and have an incredible memory.
&nbsp;
When your ability to think, analyze things, or plan would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You have an uncanny knack for reading others. You can see through falsehoods, grasp somebody's true intention, and generally glean insights that others would see as an incredible leap of logic.
&nbsp;
When your ability to read people would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You have an innate quality about you that puts people at ease in your presence. Strangers warm to you quickly, are quick to offer a helping hand, and are more likely to share information with you.
&nbsp;
When your charm and ability to persuade would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You have a silver tongue and the lies you spin are often more believable than the truth. You can plant the seeds of a truth or a thought throughout a conversation and watch your mark come to the conclusion you want all on their own.
&nbsp;
When your guile would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You are fantastically strong, approaching the limits of what a human can do unaided by craft. You can overpower creatures twice your size, and lift far beyond your weight.
&nbsp;
When your physical strength would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.

You are fast and able to easily navigate the world around you. When their is a question of who gets somewhere first it is nearly always you, and you can easily navigate even difficult terrain.
&nbsp;
When your speed, agility, and general maneuverability would aid in a situation, gain +1 die on an appropriate Skill Challenge or Interaction.
